shortdesc Matrices/tensor typesetting
longdesc The mattens package contains the definitions to typeset
longdesc matrices, vectors and tensors as used in the engineering
longdesc community for the representation of common vectors and tensors
longdesc such as forces, velocities, moments of inertia, etc.
